==Drop Locations==
{{DropLocations}}

==Notes==
*Shield bonus is additive with bonuses such as {{M|Redirection}}.
*Shield Recharge Rate bonus is additive with bonuses such as {{M|Fast Deflection}}.
*Unlike [[Arcane Aegis]], Shield Recharge Rate can be interrupted by damage, but with a greatly reduced Shield Recharge Delay.
*Once the ability duration ends, shields will go back to normal, leaving excess shields as [[Shield#Overshield|overshields]].
*Has a cooldown of '''30''' seconds.
*Will not grant shields if the user does not possess base shields of their own.
*Unlike [[Shield Osprey]], it does not instantly recharge shields.
*[[Sentinels]], [[Companions]], [[Rescue|Rescue Targets]], [[Syndicate]] [[Operative]]s [[Syndicate#Rank1|Syndicate Specters]] or [[Invasion|Factional Allies]] cannot benefit from this mod.

